  "description": "Janglim is an embeddable LALR parser-generator engine for .NET. Define grammars in C# or EBNF text with typed tokens and registered C# predicates. Preserve token trivia and line breaks, predict two-way Shift/predicate epsilon Reduce conflicts, and inspect tables, FIRST/FOLLOW sets, traces, syntax trees, and diagnostics. Includes grammar validation, incremental reparsing, and pluggable error recovery.",
  "iconFile": "icon.png",
  "id": "Janglim",
  "isPrerelease": false,
  "lastEdited": "2026-10-19T04:03:44.87Z",
